Changes from MeTube began on 2026-11-10 and are recorded in this repository's
git history. They include a format picker and link preview, re-encoding to the
chosen audio bitrate, lyrics lookup, video subtitles, a disk-space check,
a reworked interface and branding, checksum-pinned image builds, installers,
and a new CI and release pipeline.

